main would be preferred  \n\n\n Hands -on expertise in  \nSQL is a must  \n\n\n Exposure of  \ndeveloping analytical reports on Tableau/Power BI is preferred .","Opportunity for Data Analytics ( SQL + Power BI) (Pune)",null,null,0,[["organization","Recognized"],["publisher_name","Shine"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bc2bf2e67461101:0x828d43bf9d9ee343"],["cluster_id","0xa3569421d964c90a"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"av74asyBLPqkhvcP-7uywQE77":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[43911100,0.50081027,4]]],"av74asyBLPqkhvcP-7uywQE81":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Analyst+in+Pune+with+4+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003d_MOQ841_TIU7Lsj6AAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_xWNSw4BURBFY2oJJu7QL90iMWFEJCIhGguQ0kp3S3v18qrEZ2QPNmJNVqJN7uicc-ufWj1Zey_Brq6wB04SMCMjTByVDytSRQu7zRJdJHLjgOmijVZyddzG9_XGWQ5QppDmEIe5SFZyY5ybeR3FsWoZZWpUdaJULrE4Psg9riT9z15zCuxLMt4Phv175F3WaW45lcwVTz6icPhf9bCiiiTNLdAP6y5tbrMAAAA\u0026shmds\u003dv1_Ac3VAowcfy2Kk2JJvGbomz5FnPzmdWWRmWIZO9WjlPIGjoCrqQ\u0026source\u003dsh/x/job/uv/m5/1#fpstate\u003dtldetail\u0026htivrt\u003djobs\u0026htidocid\u003d_MOQ841_TIU7Lsj6AAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026htiq\u003dData+Analyst+in+Pune+with+4+years+of+experience+jobs",null,null,"Opportunity for Data Analytics ( SQL + Power BI) (Pune)",null,null,null,null,1,null,37,["H4sIAAAAAAAA_xWNSw4BURBFY2oJJu7QL90iMWFEJCIhGguQ0kp3S3v18qrEZ2QPNmJNVqJN7uicc-ufWj1Zey_Brq6wB04SMCMjTByVDytSRQu7zRJdJHLjgOmijVZyddzG9_XGWQ5QppDmEIe5SFZyY5ybeR3FsWoZZWpUdaJULrE4Psg9riT9z15zCuxLMt4Phv175F3WaW45lcwVTz6icPhf9bCiiiTNLdAP6y5tbrMAAAA","v1_Ac3VAowcfy2Kk2JJvGbomz5FnPzmdWWRmWIZO9WjlPIGjoCrqQ"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null