), strong technical skills in SQL and Excel, and proven ability to collaborate with Business stakeholders across timezones and external SaaS vendors. Experience in Life Sciences or related domains is a strong advantage.\n\nREQUIRED SKILLS\n\n Strong technical expertise in SQL (queries, joins, data validation) and Excel (Power Query, pivot tables, advanced formulas).\n Exposure to Powershell is recommended but not mandated.\n Familiarity with ETL concepts and tools.\n Excellent problem-solving and stakeholder communication skills.\n\nADDITIONAL INFORMATION:\n\n Alignment to UK working hours.\n Confirmation that being assigned to the project will negate any requirement for the colleague to attend Cognizant offices.\n\nThanks Amol .","Data Migration Analyst",null,null,0,[["organization","Info Way Solutions LLC"],["publisher_name","Shine"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bc2bf2e67461101:0x828d43bf9d9ee343"],["cluster_id","0x8ec503ffeaaedde7"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"av74asyBLPqkhvcP-7uywQE53":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[43911100,0.044067208,4]]],"av74asyBLPqkhvcP-7uywQE78":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Analyst+in+Pune+with+4+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003dfwYn6NY7DnmX62CTAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_xXNMQrCQBCFYWxzBKupVbIi2GglCiIkIFhYhklYdyPrTNiZQNJ5B0tv50ncNK_5-XjZd5aZEypC2bqI2jLBgTCMovB7f-DJNYjF2HhI5czsgp3vvWonO2NEQu5EE2vyhl-GydY8mIRkmko8RtsFVFtttush78gtlhd6MNxxhBuHfjoUKIojtATXnuwKSkwKxWvEP4Bou3ueAAAA\u0026shmds\u003dv1_Ac3VAoyoRC587vNJvtUGsxJgy_it-csxI_vMgb_vBiyXTR1Jgg\u0026source\u003dsh/x/job/uv/m5/1#fpstate\u003dtldetail\u0026htivrt\u003djobs\u0026htidocid\u003dfwYn6NY7DnmX62CTAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026