hvcP-7uywQE56":[[0,"https://www.jobleads.com/in/job/marketing-data-analyst--pune-district--e352c6f064d39e18858fead4de1025684","jobs","KfdMn2oscu98qM","\u003cp\u003eCome work at a place where innovation and teamwork come together to support the most exciting missions in the world!\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eQualys is looking for a highly analytical, technically strong and business-oriented Marketing Data Analyst to join our Marketing Operations organization in Pune. This role sits at the intersection of Marketing, Sales, Revenue Operations, Marketing Technology, Data and Analytics. The ideal candidate will combine strong analytical capabilities with hands‑on experience across CRM, marketing automation, business intelligence and data platforms. The role is designed for someone who can work with data, understand processes, identify business problems, build scalable solutions, automate manual processes, and translate complex data into actionable business insights.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe candidate should be proactive and comfortable working closely with global stakeholders, including Campaign Managers, Product Marketing Managers, Sales and Revenue Operations teams. The role will be responsible for providing meaningful marketing data and performance insights, helping stakeholders evaluate campaign effectiveness, ROI and overall business impact, and enabling them to make informed, data-driven decisions. The ability to proactively identify trends, opportunities and areas for improvement – and translate them into actionable recommendations – will be critical to success in this role.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Responsibilities\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFunnel \u0026 Performance Analytics\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eAnalyze the end-to-end marketing and sales funnel, including Lead, MQL, SAL/SQL, Opportunity, Pipeline and Revenue stages.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIdentify funnel conversion rates, bottlenecks, leakage, drop-off points and opportunities for optimization.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAnalyze pipeline velocity, lead quality, campaign contribution and marketing-sourced / marketing-influenced pipeline.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDevelop analytical frameworks to evaluate the effectiveness of marketing programs and initiatives.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePartner with Marketing, Sales and Revenue Operations teams to identify opportunities to improve funnel performance.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eMarketing Reporting, Dashboards \u0026 Insights\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eBuild and maintain executive-ready dashboards and reporting frameworks using Tableau, Power BI, Salesforce and other data sources.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDevelop recurring and ad-hoc reporting for Marketing, Sales and leadership stakeholders.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eEstablish consistent definitions and reporting methodologies for key marketing metrics.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eEnsure data accuracy, consistency and reconciliation across CRM, marketing automation and BI platforms.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eTurn complex datasets into clear insights, recommendations and actionable business narratives.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eData Analysis, SQL \u0026 Data Lake Querying\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eWrite and optimize complex SQL queries to extract, transform and analyze large datasets.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eUse CQL / data-lake query languages and related query environments to retrieve and analyze marketing datasets.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePerform segmentation, cohort analysis, funnel analysis and campaign performance analysis.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCombine data from multiple martech systems and data sources to create meaningful business insights.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eInvestigate data discrepancies, perform root‑cause analysis and work with technical teams to resolve data issues.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDevelop reusable queries, datasets and analytical frameworks to reduce manual reporting effort.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSalesforce \u0026 Martech Systems\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eWork extensively with Salesforce data, including Leads, Contacts, Accounts, Campaigns, Opportunities and related marketing objects.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eUnderstand CRM data structures, lifecycle stages, campaign membership, lead routing and funnel progression.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePartner with Marketing Operations and Sales / Revenue Operations teams to improve CRM data quality and reporting.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSupport the design and optimization of marketing processes, workflows and data models.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMonitor data integrity and identify opportunities to improve CRM governance.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eMarketing Technology \u0026 Automation\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eWork with marketing automation and Martech platforms such as Adobe Marketo Engage, Salesforce and other platforms.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSupport integrations and data flows between marketing automation, CRM, enrichment, analytics and other systems.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIdentify repetitive or manual processes and develop scalable automation solutions.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCollaborate with Marketing Operations and IT / Business Systems teams on system enhancements, integrations and troubleshooting.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eEvaluate new technologies and AI / automation capabilities that can improve marketing efficiency.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCampaign, Channel \u0026 Market Analytics\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eMeasure performance across campaigns, programs, events, webinars, digital channels and other marketing initiatives.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAnalyze campaign engagement, conversion, pipeline contribution and ROI.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSupport segmentation and targeting using firmographic, behavioral, engagement and CRM data.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDevelop insights that help Marketing teams optimize audience targeting, campaign execution and investment.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eData Quality \u0026 Governance\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eMonitor and improve data quality across Martech platforms.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIdentify duplicate, incomplete, inconsistent or inaccurate records and develop solutions to address root causes.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eEstablish and maintain data definitions, business rules and documentation.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePartner with stakeholders to ensure consistent lifecycle, campaign, attribution and funnel definitions.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCross-Functional Partnership\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eWork closely with Marketing Operations, Demand Generation, Product Marketing, Sales, Revenue Operations, Finance, IT and Data teams.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eTranslate business requirements into analytical, technical and operational solutions.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCommunicate findings clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAct as a subject matter expert for marketing data, analytics and reporting.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eProactively identify opportunities to improve marketing processes rather than simply responding to reporting requests.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eRequired Skills \u0026 Experience\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e4–7 years of experience in Marketing Analytics, Marketing Operations, Revenue Operations, Business Analytics, martech Engineering or a related analytical / technical role.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStrong hands‑on experience with SQL - mandatory.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eHands‑on experience with CQL / data-lake querying - mandatory.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStrong hands‑on experience with Salesforce - mandatory, including understanding of CRM data structures, campaigns, leads, contacts, accounts and opportunities.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eHands‑on experience with BI / visualization platforms, with strong preference for Tableau and Power BI.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStrong understanding of B2B marketing and sales funnels, including Lead → MQL → SAL/SQL → Opportunity → Pipeline → Revenue.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStrong analytical and problem‑solving skills, with the ability to investigate data and identify root causes.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAbility to translate business questions into data requirements, analysis and actionable recommendations.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStrong Excel / Google Sheets skills, including advanced formulas, pivot tables and data analysis.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExcellent written and verbal communication skills.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAbility to work effectively with global stakeholders across different time zones.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e","Marketing Data Analyst",null,null,0,[["organization","Qualys"],["organization_mid","/m/02r2qzd"],["publisher_name","JobLeads"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bc2c04d2e551403:0x421f6cdcc9be5071"],["cluster_id","0x73bc72a19fa83d6b"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"av74asyBLPqkhvcP-7uywQE59":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[43911100,0.17984699,4]]],"av74asyBLPqkhvcP-7uywQE70":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Analyst+in+Pune+with+4+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003d73Isap9M9ymLi4IQAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_xWMMQrCQBAAsc0TtNlaJCeCjVaCYBXQF4TNsdydnrvhdgOxs7f0h77EpJlqZqrPonINlgdZ4gBnNIQTY36pwe_9hbt0oITFRxCGi0jItDxGs14PzqnmOqihJV97eTph6mR0U6Qz